abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the positional foundation of carry geometry,
  including unique quotient-remainder decomposition, forced finite-alphabet
  normalization, arithmetic carry propagation, uniform carry probability,
  quadratic amplitude rigidity, and base independence.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - positional representation
  - carry geometry
  - finite alphabet
  - Euclidean normalization
  - quadratic amplitude
  - base independence
  - reproducible proof audit
